{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/15aa2fbbeb5069d96d2af26f9b48f7fc.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been a decade since a pandemic swept through the world. Billions were infected by a bacteriophage that first killed them, then brought them back under its control, turning them into violent monsters... Entirely conscious of their actions until someone finally puts them out of their misery. You are that someone, part of an elite search and rescue unit responsible for evacuating human survivors from infected areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/e59f0294741b16ed3a13f42dc0dcdd21.poster.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/e59f0294741b16ed3a13f42dc0dcdd21.webm?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/e59f0294741b16ed3a13f42dc0dcdd21.mp4?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Infect Cam: High stakes, adrenaline-fueled co-op survival, where you and your team of four are always outnumbered and facing impossible odds, fighting against an endless horde, managing scarce resources, and keeping each other safe in a deployment that might change the fortunes of humanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/f31e1b7e8a5955ade3069bdd7d72531f.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Player Tactical Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rescue team has four members. Alone, none will survive and only together do you have a chance. Communicate with each other and work closely to avoid being overwhelmed, share resources, and plan for each encounter to make sure you have a fighting chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/346982cf9417360513379e367ea9d973.poster.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/346982cf9417360513379e367ea9d973.webm?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/346982cf9417360513379e367ea9d973.mp4?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive The Impossible</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment counts - and so does every bullet, medkit, and teammate. Experience the struggle for survival from the level of a body cam, dealing with limited visibility, scrounging for supplies, and constantly staying on your toes, making decisions that can save or doom your rescue team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/d9e7f5ff1f758407ec06391888ce3064.poster.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/d9e7f5ff1f758407ec06391888ce3064.webm?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/d9e7f5ff1f758407ec06391888ce3064.mp4?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search &amp; Rescue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a distinct experience, spread across multiple maps, each more challenging than the last. The closer you get to your objective, the more dangerous the zombies and the fewer the resources. Change and adapt your strategies and teamwork to find survivors, save them - and maybe find something to help find a cure for the plague...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3168930?t=1757438624","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/2702b1b0d68fd8f8c8494c1fabe9676639084544/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757438624","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/e5d5b18901c9e1ea0a414b385cbe191d5cb5b5e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757438624","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/e5d5b18901c9e1ea0a414b385cbe191d5cb5b5e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757438624","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages or may be unsuitable for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"demos":[{"appid":3548180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/15aa2fbbeb5069d96d2af26f9b48f7fc.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been a decade since a pandemic swept through the world. Billions were infected by a bacteriophage that first killed them, then brought them back under its control, turning them into violent monsters... Entirely conscious of their actions until someone finally puts them out of their misery. You are that someone, part of an elite search and rescue unit responsible for evacuating human survivors from infected areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/e59f0294741b16ed3a13f42dc0dcdd21.poster.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/e59f0294741b16ed3a13f42dc0dcdd21.webm?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/e59f0294741b16ed3a13f42dc0dcdd21.mp4?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Infect Cam: High stakes, adrenaline-fueled co-op survival, where you and your team of four are always outnumbered and facing impossible odds, fighting against an endless horde, managing scarce resources, and keeping each other safe in a deployment that might change the fortunes of humanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/f31e1b7e8a5955ade3069bdd7d72531f.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Player Tactical Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rescue team has four members. Alone, none will survive and only together do you have a chance. Communicate with each other and work closely to avoid being overwhelmed, share resources, and plan for each encounter to make sure you have a fighting chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/346982cf9417360513379e367ea9d973.poster.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/346982cf9417360513379e367ea9d973.webm?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/346982cf9417360513379e367ea9d973.mp4?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive The Impossible</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment counts - and so does every bullet, medkit, and teammate. Experience the struggle for survival from the level of a body cam, dealing with limited visibility, scrounging for supplies, and constantly staying on your toes, making decisions that can save or doom your rescue team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/d9e7f5ff1f758407ec06391888ce3064.poster.avif?t=1757438624\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/d9e7f5ff1f758407ec06391888ce3064.webm?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/d9e7f5ff1f758407ec06391888ce3064.mp4?t=1757438624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search &amp; Rescue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a distinct experience, spread across multiple maps, each more challenging than the last. The closer you get to your objective, the more dangerous the zombies and the fewer the resources. Change and adapt your strategies and teamwork to find survivors, save them - and maybe find something to help find a cure for the plague...</p>","developers":["Ravenholm Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/00df61aa7ba4fb0f5b4efe93a00e55c8417046f6/header.jpg?t=1757438624","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Ravenholm Interactive & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116529,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116529/movie480.mp4?t=1742850816","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116529/movie_max.mp4?t=1742850816"},"name":"Steam Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116529/17d669e6824cfb247c51300daf84d10195ab36a9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742850816","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116529/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742850816","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116529/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742850816"}}],"name":"Infect Cam","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11500 veya AMD Ryzen 5 4500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super veya AMD Radeon RX 590 (8 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><s